  "question": {
    "text": "If the function <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> defined as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is continuous at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then the value of <math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "63.75",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Since, <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is continuous at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> so, at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> both left hand and right hand limits must exist and both must be equal to <math><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br />Now,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br />If <math><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> exists, then <math><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p>",
